@startuml sequence-3-order
!include style.iuml
title Restaurant Rush | Turn 7: choose, price and prepare (sequence 3 of 4)
caption Continues after page 2: the Waiter may order for a customer the Host seated this turn.
boundary "ui : ConsoleUI" as UI
control "controller : TurnController" as TC
participant "waiter : Waiter" as Waiter
entity "state : GameState" as State
participant "c3 : RegularCustomer" as C3
entity "o3 : Order" as O3
participant "Money\n(static)" as Money
participant "chef : Chef" as Chef
autonumber

UI -> TC : submit(Action(WAITER, ORDER, "C3"))
TC -> Waiter : takeOrder(state, "C3")
Waiter -> State : customer("C3")
State --> Waiter : c3
Waiter -> C3 : order(); status()
C3 --> Waiter : empty; SEATED
Waiter -> State : menu()
State --> Waiter : Stage 3 Menu
Waiter -> C3 : chooseMeal(menu)
note right of C3
  Dynamic dispatch through Customer:
  Regular index 3 is divisible by 3, so chooses the offered combo.
  VIP would cycle; Critic would always choose Pasta.
  No staff/controller customer-type checks.
end note
C3 --> Waiter : shared ComboMeal("Salad + Pasta combo")
Waiter -> State : nextOrderId()
State --> Waiter : "O3"
Waiter -> C3 : discountPercent()
C3 --> Waiter : 0
Waiter -> State : turn(); happyHourActive()
State --> Waiter : 7; true
create O3
Waiter -> O3 : new Order("O3", "C3", combo, 0, 7, true)
O3 -> Money : applyDiscount(2430, 0)
Money --> O3 : 2430
O3 -> Money : applyDiscount(2430, 20)
Money --> O3 : 1944
note right of O3
  PLACED; unitsDone = 0; unitsRequired = 3.
  Final billCents = 1944. Combo's 2430 price was computed
  when GameSetup built the menu: (900 + 1800) * 90%.
end note
Waiter -> State : addOrder(o3)
Waiter -> C3 : attachOrder(o3)
Waiter --> TC : accepted; "C3 orders Salad + Pasta combo ($19.44) as O3"
TC -> State : setPhase(CHEF)
TC --> UI : accepted ActionResult
UI -> TC : submit(Action(CHEF, PREPARE, "O3"))
TC -> Chef : prepare(state, "O3")
Chef -> State : order("O3")
State --> Chef : o3
Chef -> O3 : isPreparable()
O3 --> Chef : true
Chef -> O3 : advanceOneUnit(7)
note right of O3 : PREPARING, 1/3 units; not yet servable.
Chef --> TC : accepted; "O3 unit 1 of 3 done"
TC -> State : setPhase(TURN_END)
TC --> UI : accepted ActionResult
ref over UI, TC : Page 4: end turn 7, recovery/preparation, serving, eating and payment.

note over Waiter, O3
  All legality checks precede nextOrderId(), so rejection cannot skip an ID.
  Customer stores the order reference but never calls its methods.
  Bill computation belongs to Order/Money, not the UI or customer.
end note
footer Constructor arrow abbreviates creation syntax; the complete price order is personal discount then Happy Hour, rounded per step.
@enduml
